    <h2>What plumbing repairs run in Plano</h2>
    <p>Routine service calls — drain clearing, a running toilet, a dripping faucet — typically land $125–$450 in North Texas. Slab leaks are more common on Plano's east side, where the ground is Blackland Prairie clay rather than the more stable Austin Chalk to the west, and repairs there can run $1,500–$15,000 depending on access and tunneling.</p>
